    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit",
        "text": "Guh..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_139#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_143#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dawn",
        "text": "Ink Spirits. Ink... Spirit. What a beautiful name."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dawn",
        "text": "Saga is such an bright girl."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dawn",
        "text": "Again and again, she protects the things she knows can't be damaged. I wonder if that means they will grow sick of this pointless exercise and give up on that righteousness one of these days?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dawn",
        "text": "I suppose she will. After all, if you can restore broken porcelain, then it's not going to be much of a heartbreak at all to see it shatter into pieces."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dawn",
        "text": "You might even come to enjoy the feeling of breaking it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_139#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_143#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit",
        "text": "...Gaa?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_139",
            "name2": "avg_npc_143#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dawn",
        "text": "But do we have to go that far...? Human nature is no match for these trials and tribulations."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_139",
            "name2": "avg_npc_143#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit",
        "text": "...Goh..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_139#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dawn",
        "text": "Are you watching, Dusk?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dawn",
        "text": "You are such a meanie... I only hope don't mind what I have planned."
    },
